      "reason": "Identifying the subject is enough: the description concerns geographic reach and identification of covered locations, whereas d03 and d04 concern the meaning of “covered loss” and its asserted priority over the general grant. The claim that location identification is contested need not be resolved to distinguish those problems."
    },
    {
      "id": "a03",
