      "reason": "The reviewer needs only to distinguish the alleged geographic inconsistency from d05’s functional-versus-cosmetic meaning dispute and d06’s specific-versus-general construction argument. Although it cites the same grants, its express focus on differing geographic reach makes the comparison clear without resolving its transit assertion."
